@rmm5t Good call, thanks! I added an entry to `new_framework_defaults_7_0`.

> I'm not sure we should be spending too much time on super-early adopters. 

I am concerned that the consequences are too serious for people running edge-Rails. Suddenly, you upgrade to latest `main` and your existing production data fails to decrypt. It can be super-confusing, so I am happy to put the extra-effort here. I think it's a _small_ extra effort 😅.
